WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:54.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:55.000 --> 00:58.000
"Not Yours"

3
00:58.100 --> 01:00.800
(Episode 1)

4
01:27.359 --> 01:28.359
Boss P'Eng.

5
01:29.280 --> 01:30.799
These cigarettes seem a bit damp.

6
01:31.120 --> 01:32.399
I've already had someone fetch a fresh pack.

7
01:32.400 --> 01:33.480
They'll be here any second.

8
01:33.879 --> 01:35.680
This pack was kept with Xiaofang.

9
01:36.120 --> 01:38.096
Last time, because the drink he mixed was too fizzy,

10
01:38.120 --> 01:39.680
didn't you pour it over his head?

11
01:40.040 --> 01:41.120
They probably got splashed.

12
02:02.760 --> 02:04.760
Are these the candidates for Boss P'Eng to review?

13
02:05.079 --> 02:06.079
Yes.

14
02:06.439 --> 02:07.439
Yeah.

15
02:14.840 --> 02:16.160
Here are Boss P'Eng's cigarettes.

16
02:19.680 --> 02:20.680
Hold on a second.

17
02:24.120 --> 02:25.440
Boss P'Eng wants you to light it.

18
02:25.759 --> 02:26.759
Me?

19
02:28.400 --> 02:29.400
Boss P'Eng.

20
02:30.400 --> 02:31.400
Boss P'Eng.

21
02:37.152 --> 02:38.152
Allow me.

22
02:56.960 --> 02:57.960
Boss P'Eng.

23
03:19.120 --> 03:21.280
Who gave you permission to tie that red bandana on him?

24
03:21.919 --> 03:22.919
I...

25
03:23.439 --> 03:25.159
Didn't Taozi always wear one?

26
03:25.319 --> 03:27.520
I figured Boss P'Eng was into that look.

27
03:27.960 --> 03:29.999
This kid sure got lucky.

28
03:30.000 --> 03:32.879
It's hard to say if it's a blessing or a curse.

29
03:41.159 --> 03:42.159
Come here.

30
04:01.080 --> 04:02.080
Take it off.

31
04:14.280 --> 04:15.280
And that too.

32
04:27.240 --> 04:28.240
Open your mouth.

33
04:28.839 --> 04:29.879
B-Boss P'Eng.

34
04:30.600 --> 04:31.600
What did you say?

35
04:38.879 --> 04:39.920
I told you...

36
04:40.040 --> 04:41.480
open your mouth.

37
04:59.759 --> 05:01.759
You think you're worthy of dressing like this?

38
06:15.240 --> 06:16.240
Wow.

39
06:19.759 --> 06:20.240
A Pong.

40
06:20.560 --> 06:22.199
This is ready, take it out.

41
06:25.097 --> 06:26.017
Don't start.

42
06:26.041 --> 06:27.559
The girl from Huabo who just ordered...

43
06:27.560 --> 06:29.120
took a call and vanished into thin air.

44
06:29.639 --> 06:32.360
Oh, she ordered but isn't eating?

45
06:33.399 --> 06:34.920
She's here chasing celebrities.

46
06:35.199 --> 06:36.999
Said some big star from Huabo...

47
06:37.000 --> 06:38.240
is coming here to shoot a show.

48
06:39.480 --> 06:40.599
She answered a call...

49
06:40.600 --> 06:42.398
and dashed out like she won the lottery.

50
06:42.399 --> 06:43.479
Isn't that wild?

51
06:43.480 --> 06:45.720
Hey, she's actually from my hometown.

52
06:46.079 --> 06:47.638
She already paid for this fried rice.

53
06:47.639 --> 06:48.639
Said it's on her.

54
06:49.160 --> 06:51.920
I just can't understand how crazy fans are these days.

55
06:52.439 --> 06:53.639
Well, that's great.

56
06:54.000 --> 06:55.800
We can bring it over for Xiaotong and Xiaoya.

57
06:57.199 --> 06:58.399
Let's just eat it ourselves.

58
07:00.240 --> 07:01.240
A Pong.

59
07:01.399 --> 07:03.536
There's a celebrity coming to the night market tonight.

60
07:03.560 --> 07:05.278
It's going to be packed with people.

61
07:05.279 --> 07:07.439
Xiaotong and Xiaoya will probably be exhausted.

62
07:07.600 --> 07:09.920
How about this? If you want some,

63
07:10.800 --> 07:12.559
I can save half for you, okay?

64
07:12.560 --> 07:13.120
It's fine.

65
07:13.121 --> 07:14.198
I'm not that hungry.

66
07:14.199 --> 07:15.199
Let the kids have it all.

67
07:15.319 --> 07:18.529
Let them eat their fill so they'll have the energy to help us draw in customers.

68
07:18.560 --> 07:20.520
We're definitely going to make a killing tonight.

69
07:25.560 --> 07:27.119
Why was the shoot moved up?

70
07:27.120 --> 07:28.320
Wasn't it scheduled for eight?

71
07:28.680 --> 07:30.359
The production crew was worried about too many fans gathering...

72
07:30.360 --> 07:31.240
and causing a riot.

73
07:31.241 --> 07:32.519
So they started early.

74
07:36.920 --> 07:38.199
That guy's outfit today...

75
07:38.519 --> 07:39.680
Did you approve it?

76
07:39.920 --> 07:40.920
It was my negligence.

77
07:41.439 --> 07:42.679
I didn't check thoroughly beforehand.

78
07:42.680 --> 07:44.160
I'm willing to accept any punishment.

79
07:45.040 --> 07:46.839
You should know my rules better than anyone.

80
07:48.319 --> 07:49.878
Anyone who tries to imitate his look...

81
07:49.879 --> 07:51.079
and appears in front of me...

82
07:52.319 --> 07:53.480
has a death wish.

83
07:56.160 --> 07:57.160
There won't be a next time.

84
07:57.161 --> 07:58.576
There absolutely won't be a next time.

85
07:58.600 --> 08:00.016
I'll write a formal apology as soon as I get back.

86
08:00.040 --> 08:01.120
And reflect on my mistakes.

87
08:05.360 --> 08:06.399
That boy...

88
08:06.879 --> 08:07.879
send him to the hospital.

89
08:08.680 --> 08:09.680
I'll cover the expenses.

90
08:43.039 --> 08:44.158
Excuse me.

91
08:44.159 --> 08:45.199
Excuse me, coming through.

92
08:46.480 --> 08:47.240
Excuse me, coming through.

93
08:47.240 --> 08:48.039
Please make way.

94
08:48.200 --> 08:49.039
Thank you.

95
08:49.039 --> 08:49.720
Please make way.

96
08:49.720 --> 08:50.720
Thanks.

97
08:51.120 --> 08:52.639
Coming through.

98
08:53.759 --> 08:54.759
Excuse me, coming through.

99
08:54.760 --> 08:55.918
Excuse me.

100
08:55.919 --> 08:56.840
A Pong.

101
08:56.919 --> 08:58.119
There are so many people today.

102
08:58.120 --> 08:59.120
Yeah.

103
09:00.159 --> 09:01.319
Excuse me, coming through.

104
09:01.320 --> 09:02.320
Excuse me.

105
09:19.879 --> 09:21.399
I wonder how business is doing.

106
09:22.000 --> 09:23.280
Looks like they're selling well.

107
09:25.159 --> 09:26.039
Xiaotong.

108
09:26.159 --> 09:26.960
Brother!

109
09:26.961 --> 09:28.038
Brother A Pong!

110
09:28.039 --> 09:29.119
How are sales?

111
09:29.120 --> 09:30.120
Good.

112
09:30.440 --> 09:31.440
Thank you.

113
09:32.840 --> 09:34.079
How are sales going today?

114
09:34.080 --> 09:35.080
Xiaoya.

115
09:35.559 --> 09:36.200
Brother!

116
09:36.200 --> 09:37.080
There's a huge crowd today.

117
09:37.081 --> 09:38.239
The flowers are almost sold out.

118
09:38.240 --> 09:40.158
That's amazing! You haven't eaten yet, right?

119
09:40.159 --> 09:41.296
You and your sister go eat first.

120
09:41.320 --> 09:42.360
I'll clean up the rest.

121
09:48.960 --> 09:49.960
Come have a taste.

122
09:51.799 --> 09:53.320
Egg fried rice.

123
09:55.360 --> 09:55.960
Thanks, brother!

124
09:55.960 --> 09:56.960
Mmhmm.

125
09:57.120 --> 09:58.599
Wow, egg fried rice!

126
09:58.600 --> 10:00.000
It's been so long since I had this.

127
10:06.720 --> 10:07.720
A Pong.

128
10:07.840 --> 10:09.080
You can't sell this stuff here.

129
10:09.519 --> 10:10.240
It's fine.

130
10:10.241 --> 10:11.881
The cops won't come around here at night.

131
10:30.360 --> 10:31.399
Careful, young master.

132
10:49.080 --> 10:50.120
This way.

133
10:53.480 --> 10:54.558
Excuse me, coming through.

134
10:54.559 --> 10:55.720
Excuse me, coming through.

135
10:56.440 --> 10:57.440
Excuse me.

136
10:58.360 --> 10:59.679
Coming through.

137
11:02.600 --> 11:03.600
Right here.

138
11:04.720 --> 11:05.840
What is it, young master?

139
11:06.039 --> 11:07.439
Are you sure we should go this way?

140
11:08.200 --> 11:08.799
Yes, young master.

141
11:09.200 --> 11:11.456
The road ahead is completely blocked by fans and the crowd.

142
11:11.480 --> 11:12.559
This is the only shortcut.

143
11:18.039 --> 11:19.080
This way, young master.

144
11:27.759 --> 11:28.240
Are you okay?

145
11:28.240 --> 11:28.840
What are you doing?

146
11:28.840 --> 11:29.360
Get up.

147
11:29.361 --> 11:30.761
Take it easy, everything fell over.

148
11:30.960 --> 11:31.960
Be careful.

149
11:32.200 --> 11:33.000
Are you okay?

150
11:33.120 --> 11:34.320
Go to the back for now.

151
11:36.840 --> 11:37.918
Hello.

152
11:37.919 --> 11:39.080
Do you remember me?

153
11:39.440 --> 11:40.798
You're the fried rice girl from my hometown.

154
11:40.799 --> 11:41.679
Right.

155
11:41.799 --> 11:42.559
I'm so sorry.

156
11:42.560 --> 11:43.879
We didn't notice.

157
11:44.120 --> 11:45.558
How about you tell us how much these flowers cost?

158
11:45.559 --> 11:46.759
We'll compensate you for them.

159
11:47.279 --> 11:48.440
A Pong, what's going on?

160
11:48.519 --> 11:50.758
This is the hometown girl with the fried rice I mentioned today.

161
11:50.759 --> 11:51.320
Hello.

162
11:51.321 --> 11:53.960
And she said she wants to pay for all these flowers.

163
11:54.159 --> 11:55.159
Yeah.

164
11:55.399 --> 11:56.399
It's no big deal.

165
11:57.399 --> 11:59.518
These flowers were just leftovers anyway.

166
11:59.519 --> 12:00.798
They're not worth much anyway.

167
12:00.799 --> 12:02.840
Besides, didn't you treat us to fried rice?

168
12:04.679 --> 12:06.119
He says you don't need to pay for the flowers.

169
12:06.120 --> 12:06.799
Yeah.

170
12:06.799 --> 12:07.759
Welcome to Tailan.

171
12:07.759 --> 12:08.759
Yeah.

172
12:09.240 --> 12:11.199
And thanks again for treating us to the egg fried rice earlier.

173
12:11.200 --> 12:12.439
We couldn't possibly do that.

174
12:12.440 --> 12:14.240
Let's pool our money and pay you back.

175
12:18.559 --> 12:19.559
How about this?

176
12:20.039 --> 12:21.480
You guys buy all these flowers.

177
12:21.679 --> 12:22.679
We'll give you a discount.

178
12:22.680 --> 12:24.359
Later, when your idol finishes shooting the show,

179
12:24.360 --> 12:25.398
I'll help you give them to him.

180
12:25.399 --> 12:26.200
I know the security guard.

181
12:26.200 --> 12:26.600
Really?

182
12:26.601 --> 12:27.719
You know the security guard?

183
12:27.720 --> 12:28.480
Sure.

184
12:28.480 --> 12:29.480
Sounds good!

185
12:30.279 --> 12:30.679
I really didn't expect...

186
12:30.679 --> 12:32.600
- They're actually buying them? - They're really buying them.

187
12:32.840 --> 12:33.559
Come on, kids.

188
12:33.559 --> 12:34.120
We've got work to do.

189
12:34.120 --> 12:35.120
Wrap the flowers up nicely.

190
12:35.120 --> 12:36.000
We've got big clients!

191
12:36.000 --> 12:37.000
Okay!

192
12:37.720 --> 12:39.039
We'll take all the pink ones.

193
12:39.399 --> 12:40.480
Sure, you got it!

194
12:41.039 --> 12:41.559
Look.

195
12:41.679 --> 12:42.120
Okay.

196
12:42.279 --> 12:43.839
Look, that one in the back is nice too.

197
12:45.200 --> 12:46.200
Here.

198
12:46.240 --> 12:47.240
Our homemade grape juice.

199
12:47.240 --> 12:47.600
Thank you.

200
12:47.600 --> 12:47.879
Have a taste.

201
12:47.879 --> 12:48.200
Thanks.

202
12:48.200 --> 12:49.200
Thanks.

203
12:52.720 --> 12:53.240
How is it?

204
12:53.240 --> 12:53.679
Tastes good, right?

205
12:53.679 --> 12:54.399
It's so good!

206
12:54.399 --> 12:55.399
Of course.

207
12:55.552 --> 12:58.488
Young Master, I'll call the production team to send someone to pick us up.

208
12:58.519 --> 12:59.519
Yeah.

209
13:04.159 --> 13:05.960
Is that the star you like?

210
13:06.360 --> 13:07.159
Yes.

211
13:07.160 --> 13:08.720
I'm actually a bit shy about it.

212
13:09.440 --> 13:10.200
Can I take a look?

213
13:10.200 --> 13:11.000
Sure.

214
13:11.000 --> 13:11.559
Here.

215
13:11.720 --> 13:14.038
Just how handsome is he for you to chase him all the way to Tailan?

216
13:14.039 --> 13:15.039
Take a look.

217
13:18.833 --> 13:19.833
What do you think?

218
13:20.960 --> 13:21.960
Isn't he handsome?

219
13:23.320 --> 13:24.479
He is.

220
13:24.480 --> 13:25.200
Keep it safe.

221
13:25.200 --> 13:25.879
Don't lose it.

222
13:25.960 --> 13:26.480
You've got good taste.

223
13:26.639 --> 13:27.839
Later, when he performs,

224
13:27.840 --> 13:29.360
how are you planning to cheer for him?

225
13:29.616 --> 13:31.655
We'll just give him this bouquet.

226
13:31.679 --> 13:33.639
It'd be great if you bought a lottery ticket too.

227
13:33.679 --> 13:35.079
Giving flowers is more romantic.

228
13:35.080 --> 13:36.000
Don't you get it?

229
13:36.000 --> 13:37.000
He likes flowers.

230
13:37.639 --> 13:39.439
Why don't you buy the lottery ticket as well?

231
13:39.759 --> 13:41.919
You can give him a lottery rose along with it.

232
14:14.919 --> 14:15.960
Hey, look over here!

233
14:27.080 --> 14:28.080
Are you okay?

234
14:29.720 --> 14:30.519
Are you alright?

235
14:30.519 --> 14:31.519
Get up, quick.

236
14:32.960 --> 14:34.644
I'm talking to you, can't you even say thank you?

237
14:34.668 --> 14:37.148
Mingkun, Mingkun!

238
14:39.480 --> 14:40.440
Young Master.

239
14:40.440 --> 14:41.440
What happened to you?

240
14:43.759 --> 14:44.720
What the hell are you doing?

241
14:44.720 --> 14:45.159
A Pong.

242
14:45.160 --> 14:46.200
Hurry.

243
14:46.360 --> 14:46.799
I'm so sorry.

244
14:46.799 --> 14:47.320
It's our fault.

245
14:47.320 --> 14:47.799
Young Master.

246
14:47.799 --> 14:48.799
We are truly sorry.

247
14:50.320 --> 14:51.159
Young Master.

248
14:51.160 --> 14:52.959
The production team has prepared new clothes.

249
14:52.960 --> 14:54.159
Let's go change first.

250
14:55.200 --> 14:56.200
This way.

251
14:59.159 --> 15:00.360
Break it up, everyone.

252
15:01.399 --> 15:02.440
I'm really sorry.

253
15:03.559 --> 15:04.638
Regarding compensation,

254
15:04.639 --> 15:06.239
I hope you can contact me proactively.

255
15:06.240 --> 15:07.240
Here is the phone number.

256
15:07.639 --> 15:08.798
We are really sorry.

257
15:08.799 --> 15:10.720
We didn't expect this to happen either.

258
15:10.960 --> 15:11.960
Yeah.

259
15:13.399 --> 15:14.679
What kind of person is that?

260
15:15.279 --> 15:17.518
I'd like to see which entitled brat is so arrogant.

261
15:17.519 --> 15:18.919
Yingyu Group...?

262
15:22.457 --> 15:23.217
Pao Bei.

263
15:23.241 --> 15:25.639
Isn't this the group your mom works for?

264
15:27.960 --> 15:30.360
It seems to be the flower nursery owned by the group's boss.

265
15:42.440 --> 15:45.158
Let's welcome our brand friend from Huabo,

266
15:45.159 --> 15:46.559
Li Milan.

267
15:58.480 --> 15:59.279
Hello, everyone.

268
15:59.279 --> 16:00.279
I'm Li Milan.

269
16:00.320 --> 16:02.279
I'm very happy to meet you all in Tailan.

270
16:06.120 --> 16:09.240
This is the new product endorsed by Mr. Milan.

271
16:09.399 --> 16:11.399
Please give it your full support, okay?

272
16:28.480 --> 16:30.720
This guy has changed a lot.

273
16:30.840 --> 16:31.840
A Pong.

274
16:32.440 --> 16:33.999
Here are the flowers you wanted, all wrapped up.

275
16:34.000 --> 16:35.600
They're definitely perfect for a star.

276
16:35.679 --> 16:36.679
How are you?

277
16:37.240 --> 16:38.200
How are you feeling?

278
16:38.200 --> 16:38.840
Are you okay?

279
16:38.841 --> 16:40.495
Are you sure you don't need to go to the hospital?

280
16:40.519 --> 16:41.000
Look.

281
16:41.000 --> 16:42.000
I'm perfectly fine.

282
16:42.080 --> 16:43.720
But what's up with you?

283
16:43.960 --> 16:45.359
Why did you lose your temper like that just now?

284
16:45.360 --> 16:46.600
You scared Xiaotong and Xiaoya.

285
16:47.320 --> 16:49.480
You know I hate rich snobs who love to show off.

286
16:49.679 --> 16:51.360
He was clearly the one bullying us.

287
16:51.720 --> 16:52.559
Why blame us?

288
16:52.560 --> 16:54.280
I haven't even mentioned how he held us up.

289
16:56.559 --> 16:58.239
You've got a grudge against the rich, huh?

290
16:59.759 --> 17:01.239
It's not like I haven't told you before.

291
17:01.240 --> 17:02.440
I do hate the rich.

292
17:03.600 --> 17:05.575
They were born with a silver spoon in their mouths,

293
17:05.599 --> 17:07.199
while we have to roll around in the mud.

294
17:07.200 --> 17:08.558
What we bust our asses to earn in a year

295
17:08.559 --> 17:10.176
isn't even as much as they spend in a day.

296
17:10.200 --> 17:12.239
But there's nothing we can do about it, right?

297
17:12.240 --> 17:13.480
Everyone has their own destiny.

298
17:15.976 --> 17:17.236
Wow, he's even making a heart sign.

299
17:18.359 --> 17:19.640
He's so handsome!

300
17:20.000 --> 17:21.240
No wonder he has so many fans.

301
17:23.759 --> 17:25.559
How is he handsome?

302
17:26.000 --> 17:28.759
If we put on his styling and clothes,

303
17:28.920 --> 17:30.400
wouldn't we look way better than him?

304
17:31.160 --> 17:32.680
He's obviously very handsome.

305
17:32.920 --> 17:33.920
Look.

306
17:34.920 --> 17:36.879
Mr. Milan prefers eating this,

307
17:36.880 --> 17:38.799
so please buy more of it, okay?

308
17:39.039 --> 17:40.039
Okay!

309
17:41.839 --> 17:43.960
He was super sloppy in college.

310
17:44.480 --> 17:45.656
He didn't even wash his clothes.

311
17:45.680 --> 17:47.159
Oh, really?

312
17:47.160 --> 17:49.640
Did you know him before?

313
17:50.480 --> 17:51.880
Haven't I told you before?

314
17:52.480 --> 17:55.200
He was that annoying deskmate I had in college.

315
17:57.240 --> 17:58.358
You mean the one...

316
17:58.359 --> 17:58.839
Yes.

317
17:58.840 --> 18:00.798
The one who always competed with you in college,

318
18:00.799 --> 18:01.999
the one who always bullied you?

319
18:02.000 --> 18:03.000
That's him.

320
18:03.079 --> 18:04.119
So it was him!

321
18:04.160 --> 18:05.160
Exactly.

322
18:05.920 --> 18:07.440
He's just a jerk.

323
18:07.680 --> 18:08.840
To bump into him even here...

324
18:09.000 --> 18:10.240
It's a small world for enemies.

325
18:13.200 --> 18:15.359
Hey, who knows?

326
18:15.880 --> 18:17.279
Maybe your meeting this time

327
18:17.720 --> 18:20.119
will kick off a brand new romance.

328
18:21.839 --> 18:24.919
Next, please welcome the boss of our Yingyu brand,

329
18:24.920 --> 18:27.000
the handsome Boss P'Eng!

330
18:43.279 --> 18:44.279
Hello, everyone.

331
18:44.319 --> 18:47.359
I'm the CEO of Yingyu Group,

332
18:47.400 --> 18:48.359
and also your good friend,

333
18:48.359 --> 18:49.119
Junying.

334
18:49.120 --> 18:50.359
So handsome!

335
18:50.480 --> 18:52.399
Thank you all for your support and for coming.

336
18:52.400 --> 18:53.400
Thank you.

337
18:53.880 --> 18:55.279
Who's your friend?

338
18:55.720 --> 18:57.439
He was just glaring at us fiercely,

339
18:57.440 --> 18:59.216
and now he's pretending to be a man of the people.

340
18:59.240 --> 19:00.240
Bah!

341
19:01.559 --> 19:04.319
That's why he gets to be the big boss.

342
19:04.519 --> 19:06.039
He knows exactly what to say to whom.

343
19:06.359 --> 19:07.359
What did you expect?

344
19:07.559 --> 19:09.680
Isn't he just like our restaurant boss?

345
19:09.799 --> 19:11.239
All smiles to the customers,

346
19:11.240 --> 19:12.400
but bossing us around.

347
19:13.079 --> 19:16.000
Look at him dressed like a flashy peacock.

348
19:16.400 --> 19:18.839
You'd think he was making his center debut today.

349
19:20.440 --> 19:21.799
Alright.

350
19:23.079 --> 19:25.359
Isn't that the guy who fell by the road earlier?

351
19:26.000 --> 19:27.318
Is he a star here in Tailan?

352
19:27.319 --> 19:28.200
He's so handsome!

353
19:28.201 --> 19:30.319
He's just a boss who sells soy sauce.

354
19:32.079 --> 19:33.518
He's just a boss?

355
19:33.519 --> 19:35.159
He really has that star aura.

356
19:35.160 --> 19:36.919
Are you ditching your precious Xiaolan?

357
19:36.920 --> 19:38.416
Becoming a fan of someone else so quickly?

358
19:38.440 --> 19:39.839
How is that possible?

359
19:40.400 --> 19:43.119
I've liked Xiaolan for five years.

360
19:44.440 --> 19:47.000
It hasn't been easy for him since his debut.

361
19:47.160 --> 19:49.120
How could I easily switch to liking someone else?

362
19:50.759 --> 19:52.679
It brings tears to my eyes just thinking about it.

363
19:52.680 --> 19:54.440
How hard could it possibly be for him?

364
19:55.359 --> 19:56.919
If I really had to go into detail,

365
19:56.920 --> 19:58.759
it would take hours to finish the story.

366
20:00.079 --> 20:02.599
He debuted on his company's group formation night.

367
20:03.640 --> 20:05.159
Actually, during the previous public performances,

368
20:05.160 --> 20:06.599
he was always in first place.

369
20:06.720 --> 20:08.200
But for some unknown reason,

370
20:08.599 --> 20:11.119
he ended up in last place during the finals.

371
20:11.559 --> 20:13.440
There are six people in their group, right?

372
20:13.680 --> 20:16.240
So they started calling him the eternal sixth place.

373
20:17.319 --> 20:19.200
Who knows who he managed to offend.

374
20:20.359 --> 20:22.920
This crappy company only knows how to exploit him,

375
20:23.960 --> 20:25.320
and doesn't care about him at all.

376
20:26.079 --> 20:27.758
But I'm really happy to see him today.

377
20:27.759 --> 20:29.119
Let's not talk about this anymore.

378
20:34.359 --> 20:35.598
It's fine.

379
20:35.599 --> 20:36.599
Your flowers.

380
20:37.160 --> 20:38.119
Thank you.

381
20:38.119 --> 20:39.119
Go cheer for him!

382
20:43.799 --> 20:44.920
Milan really has it tough.

383
20:45.480 --> 20:47.599
Three, two, one. It's available for purchase!

384
20:49.240 --> 20:52.039
Please support our new product.

385
20:53.000 --> 20:54.920
Milan!

386
20:57.056 --> 21:00.190
[The Yingyu Group's account livestreaming with fans commenting that they love Milan]

387
21:06.000 --> 21:07.679
Alright, besides the autographed photos,

388
21:07.680 --> 21:09.159
we've also prepared

389
21:09.160 --> 21:11.318
our limited edition gift boxes for everyone.

390
21:11.319 --> 21:13.358
It includes a custom sauce spoon

391
21:13.359 --> 21:14.880
and a Milan standee.

392
21:15.000 --> 21:16.000
The last one hundred orders!

393
21:16.001 --> 21:17.559
Three, two, one.

394
21:17.839 --> 21:18.839
The link is up!

395
21:26.160 --> 21:26.680
A Pong.

396
21:26.880 --> 21:27.559
Ah?

397
21:27.640 --> 21:29.080
Aren't you going to charge for this?

398
21:29.359 --> 21:30.000
It's fine.

399
21:30.001 --> 21:31.015
No need to charge for this.

400
21:31.039 --> 21:32.519
Later, when they're done,

401
21:32.640 --> 21:34.799
we'll give the flowers to them for free.

402
21:35.039 --> 21:36.199
They'll think we're generous,

403
21:36.400 --> 21:37.880
and then buy all the lottery tickets.

404
21:38.160 --> 21:40.038
Isn't that killing two birds with one stone?

405
21:40.039 --> 21:41.039
Yeah.

406
21:42.279 --> 21:43.279
Xiaotong, Xiaoya.

407
21:43.480 --> 21:43.880
Yeah.

408
21:43.920 --> 21:44.440
Here.

409
21:44.799 --> 21:46.480
Grab one each.

410
21:46.759 --> 21:47.759
Thanks, bro.

411
21:50.160 --> 21:51.160
Xiaotong.

412
21:51.279 --> 21:52.400
Take Xiaoya home first.

413
21:52.680 --> 21:53.480
It gets too chaotic here at night.

414
21:53.480 --> 21:54.119
I can handle this myself.

415
21:54.120 --> 21:55.839
Bro, you haven't eaten yet, right?

416
21:56.440 --> 21:57.440
I'm fine.

417
21:57.680 --> 21:58.680
You guys head home first.

418
21:59.240 --> 22:00.119
Take good care of your sister.

419
22:00.119 --> 22:01.119
Got it.

420
22:04.079 --> 22:04.720
Let's go.

421
22:04.720 --> 22:05.079
See ya.

422
22:05.080 --> 22:06.440
Bye-bye.

423
22:20.400 --> 22:21.400
Is this yours?

424
22:22.079 --> 22:23.160
Yes.

425
22:23.359 --> 22:24.440
We received a tip.

426
22:24.519 --> 22:26.359
That you're selling lottery tickets illegally.

427
22:27.839 --> 22:29.279
No, Officer.

428
22:29.720 --> 22:31.495
We're just ordinary citizens doing a little business.

429
22:31.519 --> 22:32.519
How is that illegal?

430
22:35.279 --> 22:36.119
What are you doing?

431
22:36.240 --> 22:37.240
What are you doing?

432
22:39.599 --> 22:40.758
A Pong, don't do anything rash.

433
22:40.759 --> 22:41.759
Calm down.

434
22:42.480 --> 22:44.160
We're confiscating this for a few days.

435
22:45.400 --> 22:47.000
You can pick it up at the station later.

436
22:51.160 --> 22:52.160
Let's go.

437
22:52.480 --> 22:53.480
They...

438
22:55.559 --> 22:56.798
Why would anyone report us?

439
22:56.799 --> 22:58.479
It must be that "Red Spider" from earlier.

440
22:59.440 --> 23:00.680
Who's "Red Spider"?

441
23:01.359 --> 23:03.359
That flashy, unlucky boss.

442
23:03.759 --> 23:05.239
I can't think of anyone else but him.

443
23:05.279 --> 23:05.839
Let me tell you.

444
23:06.000 --> 23:07.799
These capitalists are the most petty.

445
23:08.319 --> 23:09.639
They hold grudges over the smallest things.

446
23:09.640 --> 23:10.758
If I catch him...

447
23:10.759 --> 23:11.919
I'll definitely make him pay.

448
23:15.960 --> 23:17.439
Looks like they're wrapping up over there.

449
23:17.440 --> 23:18.798
Milan doesn't seem to be coming this way.

450
23:18.799 --> 23:19.680
What do we do?

451
23:19.799 --> 23:21.079
Do you know which way he went?

452
23:23.240 --> 23:24.240
I think it's that way.

453
23:24.480 --> 23:25.160
Yeah.

454
23:25.160 --> 23:26.160
That's the car.

455
23:26.720 --> 23:27.319
Let's go.

456
23:27.319 --> 23:27.920
Hurry up.

457
23:27.920 --> 23:28.400
Quick!

458
23:28.400 --> 23:29.400
Go!

459
23:31.400 --> 23:32.400
Excuse me.

460
23:32.640 --> 23:33.640
Coming through.

461
23:34.079 --> 23:34.519
Make way.

462
23:35.039 --> 23:36.439
Roll down the window and take this!

463
23:36.920 --> 23:38.038
These are flowers from your fans!

464
23:38.039 --> 23:39.039
Can you open the door?

465
23:39.440 --> 23:40.440
Open the door!

466
23:40.519 --> 23:41.200
Roll down the window!

467
23:41.200 --> 23:41.920
Open the door!

468
23:41.960 --> 23:43.600
Just rolling down the window is fine too!

469
23:47.440 --> 23:48.798
It's just a bouquet of flowers!

470
23:48.799 --> 23:49.920
Why so arrogant?

471
23:53.960 --> 23:55.200
Hey, excuse me.

472
23:55.519 --> 23:56.519
Coming through.

473
23:57.039 --> 23:58.039
Hold this for me.

474
23:58.359 --> 23:59.656
I'm going to get revenge on that soy sauce boss.

475
23:59.680 --> 24:00.758
You shouldn't go.

476
24:00.759 --> 24:02.079
The car will drive off soon.

477
24:02.319 --> 24:02.680
A Pong!

478
24:02.680 --> 24:03.119
It's fine.

479
24:03.359 --> 24:03.720
A Pong!

480
24:03.721 --> 24:05.401
Don't forget what your brother used to do.

481
24:07.160 --> 24:08.640
He runs way too fast.

482
24:10.960 --> 24:12.759
But I guess the flowers won't be delivered.

483
24:12.960 --> 24:13.960
Give them to me.

484
24:14.039 --> 24:14.799
It's okay.

485
24:14.880 --> 24:15.759
I'll deliver them for you.

486
24:15.759 --> 24:16.599
I promise they'll get there.

487
25:45.599 --> 25:46.599
You're stalking me.

488
25:47.960 --> 25:48.960
I...

489
25:50.079 --> 25:51.599
I'm here to deliver flowers.

490
26:20.359 --> 26:21.640
Deliver flowers?

491
26:28.839 --> 26:29.839
What flowers?

492
26:30.279 --> 26:31.279
No.

493
26:31.319 --> 26:32.319
Never mind.

494
27:06.240 --> 27:07.440
Are you messing with me?

495
27:10.400 --> 27:11.400
What do you mean?

496
27:20.119 --> 27:22.240
Are you mocking me for being damaged goods?

497
27:26.319 --> 27:27.440
Is that it?

498
27:29.359 --> 27:30.359
No, it's not that!

499
27:30.559 --> 27:31.839
These aren't for you.

500
27:32.000 --> 27:33.880
They're from fans for that celebrity.

501
27:34.000 --> 27:36.480
Who knew you'd be the one getting into that car?

502
27:37.119 --> 27:38.119
What's wrong?

503
27:38.920 --> 27:40.480
Am I not worthy of sitting in that car?

504
27:40.599 --> 27:41.599
No.

505
27:42.680 --> 27:44.599
These flowers aren't for me.

506
27:45.039 --> 27:46.559
You're trying to stalk me, aren't you?

507
27:51.559 --> 27:52.559
I thought...

508
27:53.279 --> 27:55.359
You were captivated by me earlier.

509
27:55.960 --> 27:57.400
And decided to throw yourself at me.

510
27:57.960 --> 27:59.759
Haven't had enough yet?

511
28:02.759 --> 28:04.079
Kid.

512
28:09.160 --> 28:10.936
You were the one who slipped and fell earlier.

513
28:10.960 --> 28:13.373
If we're really going to point fingers, it has nothing to do with me.

514
28:17.519 --> 28:18.640
Was that food yours?

515
28:19.359 --> 28:20.599
Was that water yours too?

516
28:23.480 --> 28:24.758
Well, yes.

517
28:24.759 --> 28:26.799
Then how can you say it has nothing to do with you?

518
28:30.240 --> 28:31.559
Who else would it be?

519
28:36.359 --> 28:37.440
Or perhaps...

520
28:37.799 --> 28:38.960
You did it on purpose.

521
28:41.079 --> 28:43.960
To intentionally get my attention.

522
28:44.880 --> 28:45.960
Huh?

523
28:48.039 --> 28:49.439
I apologize for my behavior earlier.

524
28:49.440 --> 28:50.440
However,

525
28:50.480 --> 28:51.559
I have things to do.

526
28:51.680 --> 28:53.079
So I'll be taking off now.

527
28:56.200 --> 28:56.960
What are you doing?

528
28:56.961 --> 28:58.001
What are you trying to do?

529
28:59.079 --> 29:00.079
Let go of me!

530
29:00.359 --> 29:00.839
It hurts!

531
29:00.839 --> 29:01.839
What do you want?

532
29:03.000 --> 29:04.000
Stop it!

533
29:04.359 --> 29:05.359
Let me go!

534
29:06.119 --> 29:07.119
Don't move.

535
29:09.599 --> 29:10.759
You dare mess with me?

536
29:11.000 --> 29:12.240
You're dead meat.

537
29:14.960 --> 29:16.240
What do I want to do?

538
29:16.720 --> 29:18.200
You'll find out soon enough.

539
29:20.720 --> 29:21.798
I have the right to personal freedom!

540
29:21.799 --> 29:22.880
This is kidnapping!

541
29:23.000 --> 29:24.400
Believe it or not, I can sue you!

542
29:24.920 --> 29:25.920
Fine.

543
29:29.000 --> 29:30.039
Go ahead and sue me.

544
29:52.559 --> 29:54.039
You're in quite a leisurely mood.

545
30:07.039 --> 30:08.039
Thank you.

546
30:09.160 --> 30:11.278
Boss P'Eng said you've been standing for so long today.

547
30:11.279 --> 30:12.399
You must be exhausted.

548
30:12.400 --> 30:14.880
So he wanted to treat you to a Thai massage to help you relax.

549
30:15.519 --> 30:18.160
Master Chen here exclusively serves Boss P'Eng.

550
30:18.400 --> 30:19.838
His techniques are highly professional.

551
30:19.839 --> 30:20.839
Please enjoy yourself.

552
30:21.039 --> 30:22.399
Thank you for being so thoughtful.

553
30:22.400 --> 30:23.400
You're too kind.

554
30:23.480 --> 30:25.038
Boss P'Eng also specifically instructed me to say,

555
30:25.039 --> 30:26.798
he's especially grateful for your live stream event this time.

556
30:26.799 --> 30:28.599
It brought us very impressive sales.

557
30:29.839 --> 30:31.775
It's mainly because your company's products taste great.

558
30:31.799 --> 30:33.799
I tried a few new flavors at the event earlier.

559
30:34.119 --> 30:35.119
They were all amazing.

560
30:35.680 --> 30:38.416
By the way, these are the new products we specially prepared for you.

561
30:38.440 --> 30:40.600
You can take them back and enjoy them at your leisure.

562
30:40.839 --> 30:41.839
Thank you so much.

563
30:42.160 --> 30:43.799
It's been a pleasure working with you.

564
30:44.559 --> 30:45.759
Good evening, sir.

565
30:46.279 --> 30:47.518
Do you have a reservation?

566
30:47.519 --> 30:49.519
If not, we're currently fully booked.

567
30:50.920 --> 30:51.880
Yes, I have a reservation.

568
30:51.880 --> 30:52.400
I have one.

569
30:52.640 --> 30:55.239
May I have the last name and phone number for the reservation?

570
30:55.240 --> 30:56.359
I'll look it up for you.

571
30:58.039 --> 30:59.319
Phone number...

572
31:03.119 --> 31:05.679
Sir, you can change your clothes and take a shower first.

573
31:05.680 --> 31:07.159
Master Chen will be here shortly.

574
31:07.160 --> 31:09.279
You can rest for a bit after changing.

575
31:09.319 --> 31:10.319
Okay.

576
31:11.880 --> 31:12.720
Mr. Milan.

577
31:12.721 --> 31:14.880
Boss P'Eng has some matters he needs me to handle.

578
31:15.079 --> 31:16.200
I'll take my leave now.

579
31:16.373 --> 31:19.899
When you're finished later, the car downstairs will safely take you back to your place.

580
31:20.200 --> 31:20.839
Thanks for your hard work.

581
31:20.839 --> 31:21.839
Take care.

582
31:28.920 --> 31:29.920
Phone number...

583
31:32.519 --> 31:34.078
That phone number...

584
31:34.079 --> 31:35.159
Let me think.

585
31:35.160 --> 31:36.199
Let me think.

586
31:36.200 --> 31:37.200
Regarding the compensation,

587
31:37.201 --> 31:38.761
I expect you to contact me proactively.

588
31:39.160 --> 31:40.160
This is my phone number.

589
31:45.079 --> 31:46.159
Just look it up using this.

590
31:46.480 --> 31:47.480
Okay.

591
31:52.279 --> 31:54.239
Your reserved room is S10.

592
31:54.240 --> 31:56.015
Those guests from earlier have already headed over.

593
31:56.039 --> 31:57.279
And you are?

594
31:57.759 --> 31:59.200
I'm...

595
32:00.039 --> 32:01.039
Their friend.

596
32:01.400 --> 32:02.400
A friend.

597
32:02.799 --> 32:03.799
Thanks.

598
32:03.839 --> 32:04.839
Mm-hmm.

599
32:24.119 --> 32:25.440
What's wrong with you?

600
32:28.319 --> 32:29.319
What are you doing?

601
32:29.440 --> 32:30.279
What now?

602
32:30.359 --> 32:31.400
Go to a nearby pharmacy.

603
32:31.799 --> 32:33.119
Buy a bottle of allergy medicine.

604
32:33.559 --> 32:34.559
Hurry!

605
32:38.920 --> 32:40.239
You look like you're in pretty bad shape.

606
32:40.240 --> 32:40.880
Are you okay?

607
32:41.200 --> 32:42.560
Do you need to go to the hospital?

608
32:44.039 --> 32:44.759
Hurry up.

609
32:45.039 --> 32:46.039
Cut the crap.

610
32:51.559 --> 32:52.559
What are you doing?

611
32:53.559 --> 32:54.480
Do you want me to hold your hand?

612
32:54.480 --> 32:55.480
Give me the money.

613
32:55.960 --> 32:57.600
How can I buy you medicine without money?

614
33:00.440 --> 33:01.440
About the money...

615
33:01.880 --> 33:02.920
I'll give it to you later.

616
33:03.039 --> 33:04.118
You said it.

617
33:04.119 --> 33:05.319
Don't try to stiff me later.

618
33:06.240 --> 33:07.318
If you don't come back,

619
33:07.319 --> 33:08.680
I'll die right here.

620
33:08.920 --> 33:10.000
Then go ahead and die.

621
33:24.160 --> 33:25.559
That was close.

622
33:26.200 --> 33:28.720
An unreasonable thug like you

623
33:30.240 --> 33:31.400
deserves to die anyway.

624
33:31.680 --> 33:33.320
I don't have time to play games with you.

625
33:35.039 --> 33:36.440
You're on your own. Good luck.

626
33:54.200 --> 33:55.399
Hey, your...

627
33:55.400 --> 33:57.758
your flashy boss seems to be having an allergic reaction.

628
33:57.759 --> 33:58.759
He's in that alley.

629
33:59.119 --> 34:00.399
If you don't get over there right now,

630
34:00.400 --> 34:01.680
you'll be collecting his corpse.

631
34:19.320 --> 34:20.840
This should be the place.

632
34:36.400 --> 34:37.880
Just start the massage, sir.

633
34:41.000 --> 34:42.640
I didn't walk into the wrong room, did I?

634
34:57.800 --> 34:58.320
No, you didn't.

635
34:58.440 --> 34:59.440
That's him.

636
35:02.599 --> 35:04.400
I heard from Mr. Mingkun

637
35:04.880 --> 35:06.600
that your technique is highly professional.

638
35:07.079 --> 35:08.678
You can use a bit more force.

639
35:08.679 --> 35:09.719
I can handle the pressure.

640
35:11.079 --> 35:13.239
He thinks I'm a masseur.

641
35:14.000 --> 35:15.159
What a golden opportunity.

642
35:15.840 --> 35:17.559
Since your boy A Pong stumbled upon this,

643
35:18.000 --> 35:21.199
I'll let you taste the power of Masseur Pong.

644
35:31.360 --> 35:33.598
Let me move the towel down a bit first.

645
35:33.599 --> 35:35.038
Otherwise, I can't apply enough pressure.

646
35:35.039 --> 35:36.039
Mmhmm.

647
36:09.559 --> 36:10.839
With such a rotten temper,

648
36:10.840 --> 36:12.518
you must have offended a lot of people out there.

649
36:12.519 --> 36:13.800
Serves you right.

650
36:19.000 --> 36:19.519
You...

651
36:19.520 --> 36:21.040
You really can take the pressure, huh?

652
36:21.480 --> 36:22.640
I have a high pain tolerance.

653
36:22.960 --> 36:24.280
You can press even harder.

654
36:25.920 --> 36:27.719
You asked for it.

655
36:38.400 --> 36:39.400
Sir,

656
36:39.480 --> 36:41.199
why do you have calluses on your hands?

657
36:44.360 --> 36:45.000
Oh.

658
36:45.360 --> 36:48.800
I usually lift weights and work out.

659
36:49.920 --> 36:51.080
Just staying healthy and fit.

660
36:51.920 --> 36:53.239
And toning up while I'm at it.

661
36:54.840 --> 36:57.320
Are you Tailan masseurs this competitive nowadays?

662
36:57.679 --> 36:59.440
It's even more cutthroat than our industry.

663
37:00.039 --> 37:01.599
Your industry?

664
37:02.039 --> 37:05.119
Aren't all you bosses chubby with beer bellies?

665
37:05.360 --> 37:06.518
You're the only one

666
37:06.519 --> 37:07.920
who's so fair and tender.

667
37:09.800 --> 37:10.879
Sir,

668
37:10.880 --> 37:13.120
maybe you should use some essential oil for the massage.

669
37:19.480 --> 37:20.480
You...

670
37:21.039 --> 37:22.759
Don't tell me you forgot the essential oil.

671
37:30.000 --> 37:30.679
I brought it.

672
37:30.880 --> 37:31.880
Just give me a second.

673
37:56.039 --> 37:57.439
Why is there so much for breakfast?

674
37:57.559 --> 37:59.039
Didn't I say I wanted to lose weight?

675
37:59.400 --> 38:00.639
This is enough to feed a pig.

676
38:01.199 --> 38:01.599
Young Master,

677
38:02.039 --> 38:03.719
the doctor specifically advised last night

678
38:03.960 --> 38:06.639
that your recent malnutrition has lowered your immunity,

679
38:06.719 --> 38:08.296
which triggered the severe allergic reaction.

680
38:08.320 --> 38:10.960
So he suggested we must ensure you get enough nutrients.

681
38:11.280 --> 38:12.280
Preparing all this

682
38:12.281 --> 38:13.721
doesn't mean you have to eat it all.

683
38:14.119 --> 38:15.360
It's just...

684
38:15.960 --> 38:18.359
it's just that your taste is like the weather in Manchester,

685
38:18.360 --> 38:19.439
completely unpredictable.

686
38:19.440 --> 38:20.320
Therefore,

687
38:20.440 --> 38:21.880
please pick whatever you like.

688
38:22.119 --> 38:23.399
You've been with me for so long,

689
38:23.800 --> 38:25.160
and you still don't know my taste?

690
38:25.360 --> 38:26.360
I'm sorry, Young Master.

691
38:28.719 --> 38:31.079
I only know your taste in boys.

692
38:36.119 --> 38:37.879
That flower boy who ran away last night,

693
38:37.880 --> 38:38.880
did you find him?

694
38:39.000 --> 38:39.679
My report, Young Master.

695
38:39.840 --> 38:41.799
That Mr. Pao called last night

696
38:41.800 --> 38:43.440
specifically to check on your condition.

697
38:43.599 --> 38:45.199
He must be scared out of his wits.

698
38:45.519 --> 38:48.079
Why don't we be the bigger person and let it slide this time?

699
38:48.239 --> 38:50.279
Why lower yourself to the level of a flower seller?

700
38:50.400 --> 38:51.880
He's just feeling guilty.

701
38:53.039 --> 38:54.360
Daring to disobey my orders,

702
38:54.480 --> 38:55.639
does he have a death wish?

703
38:56.679 --> 38:57.799
If he couldn't buy it, fine.

704
38:58.000 --> 38:59.399
But he agreed and then ran away.

705
38:59.400 --> 39:00.920
If it were you, could you forgive him?

706
39:01.760 --> 39:02.959
If it were me,

707
39:02.960 --> 39:04.320
I would have just walked away.

708
39:05.039 --> 39:06.079
Also, I double-checked.

709
39:06.239 --> 39:08.280
The alley where you were smoking last night

710
39:08.320 --> 39:11.199
was less than a hundred meters from our car.

711
39:14.039 --> 39:15.039
I'm not eating.

712
39:15.199 --> 39:16.199
What is this garbage?

713
39:16.360 --> 39:18.200
I told you to change the chef, but you didn't.

714
39:18.480 --> 39:19.480
Young Master,

715
39:19.760 --> 39:20.840
please calm down.

716
39:22.760 --> 39:24.359
The one who prepared all this for you today

717
39:24.360 --> 39:26.839
is the new head chef transferred from the Mandarin Oriental.

718
39:26.840 --> 39:29.038
He's the runner-up of the Bocuse d'Or

719
39:29.039 --> 39:31.119
and took third place in the World Golden Chef Award.

720
39:31.280 --> 39:34.639
He's also the eighteenth chef I've hired for you.

721
39:34.840 --> 39:36.360
What's the point of all those awards?

722
39:36.679 --> 39:38.439
I don't like this flashy, impractical stuff.

723
39:38.960 --> 39:40.480
I want food meant for humans.

724
39:40.920 --> 39:42.320
Food for humans, do you understand?

725
39:43.480 --> 39:45.959
It seems you still prefer

726
39:45.960 --> 39:48.239
the home-cooked meals Madam used to make for you.

727
39:49.159 --> 39:50.159
Right?

728
39:53.159 --> 39:54.159
I can't eat them anymore.

729
39:54.559 --> 39:56.679
Anyway, hurry up and find someone who suits my taste.

730
39:57.320 --> 39:58.799
And that boy from last night,

731
39:58.800 --> 40:00.400
I must see him today.

732
40:01.199 --> 40:02.519
I want him

733
40:03.039 --> 40:04.039
dead.

734
40:10.199 --> 40:11.799
Hey, I'm talking to you.

735
40:11.800 --> 40:12.800
Did you hear me?

736
40:12.960 --> 40:14.960
Come here and report directly to the Young Master.

737
40:17.519 --> 40:19.239
Reporting, Young Master, I heard you.

738
40:19.320 --> 40:20.759
I'll arrange for the stable hands later

739
40:20.760 --> 40:22.639
to bring out all five of our horses.

740
40:22.960 --> 40:23.960
Bring them out for what?

741
40:24.199 --> 40:25.879
Did I say I wanted to go horseback riding?

742
40:27.119 --> 40:28.158
No, Young Master.

743
40:28.159 --> 40:29.279
They're not for you to ride.

744
40:29.320 --> 40:30.800
They're prepared for that boy.

745
40:31.039 --> 40:31.800
Once we find him,

746
40:31.880 --> 40:34.135
we'll have him drawn and quartered by five horses, just as you ordered.

747
40:34.159 --> 40:35.239
You can rest assured.

748
40:38.320 --> 40:39.495
Reporting to the Young Master,

749
40:39.519 --> 40:41.000
I have something to report.

750
40:41.239 --> 40:42.239
Speak.

751
40:42.960 --> 40:43.960
Madam's...

752
40:44.000 --> 40:45.920
The diamond ring Madam left behind

753
40:46.760 --> 40:47.639
is missing.

754
40:47.640 --> 40:49.119
Missing?

755
40:50.719 --> 40:52.280
Wasn't it in the safe in the study?

756
40:52.320 --> 40:53.199
How could it be missing?

757
40:53.200 --> 40:54.400
It was probably...

758
40:54.760 --> 40:56.919
It was probably taken by Gardener Pao, who tends the garden.

759
40:56.920 --> 40:58.959
The security footage shows she was the only one who entered the study.

760
40:58.960 --> 41:00.719
And she also has a key.

761
41:01.320 --> 41:03.158
Why would the gardener have a key?

762
41:03.159 --> 41:05.800
We don't know that either.

763
41:07.440 --> 41:08.598
Do you know Auntie Pao's whereabouts?

764
41:08.599 --> 41:09.719
Or her home address?

765
41:10.159 --> 41:11.679
Yes, we do.

766
41:12.480 --> 41:14.718
Young Master, the top priority right now

767
41:14.719 --> 41:16.400
is to find Madam's ring first.

768
41:16.760 --> 41:18.479
I'll arrange for someone to look for it.

769
41:18.480 --> 41:19.480
Just wait for my news.

770
41:19.880 --> 41:22.118
It must be that jinx from last night haunting me,

771
41:22.119 --> 41:23.960
bringing all this bad luck.

772
41:26.039 --> 41:26.679
Come with me.

773
41:26.679 --> 41:27.280
Young Master!

774
41:27.280 --> 41:28.280
Young...
